Output decide-confirm.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' XDG_CONFIG_HOME=$PWD/scratch/xdg XDG_STATE_HOME=$PWD/scratch/state && cd scratch/ws/delegation-day && clear"
Enter
Show
Type "self decide confirm 01m0n7xav7r85v81r34246me9x"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "self status"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
